"Palm Elite Residence Brochure_R10_Malay (https://hims.kpkt.gov.my/files/19070/19070-4/IKLAN_BROSUR_01.pdf)\nciteturn300search11 [wordlim: 200] Published: 1.6 years ago; Long dari Lebuhraya SILK menghidupkan semula kawasan tersebut ... Lesen Pemaju: 19070/09-2025/0844(a) • Tempoh Sah: 13/09/2022-12/09/2025 • No. ... Pelan Bangunan: MPKj 6/P/8/2024 • Tarikh Siap: Ogos 2028 • Tempoh Tanah: Pegangan Bebas • Cadangan Tanah: Maybank Islamic • Jumlah Unit: 232 • Harga: RM 493,000 (Min.) – RM 690,000 (Max.) ... MAKLUMAT PEMAJUAN DAN IKLAN YANG DILULUSKAN BOLEH DISEMAK DI PORTAL TEDUH.KPKT.GOV.MY\nJalan akses Bandar Sg. Long dari Lebuhraya SILK menghidupkan semula kawasan tersebut  \nmembawa tenaga segar kepada komuniti\n\n<visual_element id=\"e1\">\nA location map centered on Bandar Mahkota Cheras / Bandar Sg. Long showing roads, highways, nearby landmarks, and a highlighted residential project “Residensi Palma Elit @Bandar Sg. Long.” Major labeled routes and places include West Port, Ke Rawang, Kuala Lumpur, Ke Karak Highway / Ampang, Lebuh Raya Persekutuan, Cheras, Pusat Membeli-belah Aeon Cheras Selatan, Hospital Columbia Asia, KESAS, Seri Kembangan, Balakong, SKVE, Cyberjaya, Putrajaya, KLIA, East-West Link, Bandar Tun Hussein Onn, MRT Batu 11 Cheras, MRT Bukit Dukung, MRT Sungai Jernih, MRT Kajang, MR2, Cheras - Kajang Highway, KL - Seremban Highway, EKVE, Lebuhraya SILK, UTAR, SK Taman Rakan, SK Seri Sekamat, SMK Saujana Impian, Impian Golf & Country Club, Lotus’s, Giant, KPJ Kajang Specialist Hospital, Hospital Kajang, Pertukaran Jalan Saujana Impian, Pertukaran Jalan Kajang, Pertukaran Jalan Nilai, Bangi, KE MANTIN / SEREMBAN, and icons for airport, hospitals, shopping, schools, golf, and attractions. The project marker is connected by a line to the map and shown with a building image and the label “Residensi Palma Elit.”\n</visual_element>\n\nMudah Disambungkan ke Lebuhraya Utama\n\nEKVE 10 km  \nKajang SILK 1.1 km  \nLebuhraya Cheras Kajang 6.5 km  \nLebuhraya